$ apprafter platform autoscale show
[exit 0]
[stdout]
Autoscale mode: up-only

Modes:
• full      VPA applies both CPU and memory recommendations (up and down)
• up-only   VPA scales resources up but never below the platform seed
• off       VPA recommendations recorded but NOT applied to pods

Set with: apprafter platform autoscale set <full|up-only|off>
[stderr]
